        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3e3e3752-37db-4b0f-8ff3-827d4c565e55).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Dubai, 47. Our man on the inside of the al-Ghazali org, &quot;Handsome Luke&quot;, has provided intel: Sebastian Sato, thought to have been killed at the Sanguine fashion show in Paris, is alive and working with the Sheikh. We&apos;d like you to attend the opening of the Burj al-Ghazali to locate and kill Sato. One note- to ensure this elimination... sticks- you will need to pierce Sato&apos;s heart with the al-Ghazali family ceremonial scimitar. Anything short of this risks Sato rising again once more.",
